@baseUrl = https://localhost:7154
@consumerToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_TOKEN
@driverToken = REPLACE_WITH_DRIVER_LOGIN_TOKEN
@driverId = 1
@studentId = 1
@feeId = 1

### Adjust baseUrl to launchSettings.json; register and create own student using existing auth flow.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/marketplace?city=Campinas&neighborhood=Centro&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{consumerToken}}

### Own service areas
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/{{driverId}}/service-areas
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"city":"Campinas","neighborhood":"Centro"}]

### Issue an invoice to a currently linked student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/monthlyfees
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentId":{{studentId}},"amount":250.00,"dueDate":"2026-10-10"}

### Pending invoices belonging to the logged-in consumer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monthlyfees/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{consumerToken}}

### Development only; repeat to check stable PaymentDate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/monthlyfees/{{feeId}}/simulate-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{consumerToken}}

### All own invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monthlyfees/mine?pendingOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{consumerToken}}
